    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Prices",
     "texto": [
      "**钱** means money; **元** is the written currency unit and **块**, the usual spoken form. **十块钱** means ten yuan.",
      "**贵** means expensive and **便宜**, cheap. **买** is to buy and **卖**, to sell. Don't confuse 买 and 卖: they differ in the top stroke."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
