     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Numbers and price",
     "texto": [
      "**多少** asks «how much/how many». To ask about an item, say **这个苹果多少钱？** («how much does this apple cost?»). In Chinese the price usually goes without a verb like «to cost»."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
